The interface IFaultInjectionTransactionalState<GrainData> has a PerformUpdate method that requires a type argument for TResult, so I need to specify it explicitly in the test. I will fix that and resubmit the test. I will also add a test for OnActivateAsync to cover the LogInformation call there. I will mock PerformUpdate and PerformRead as needed.

